      "value": "@{612fe5a5d0e977457c0c26b8|full_name}: You appear to have run into an _exceptionally_ rare edge case where the server processing that occurs on content ends up spitting out a slightly malformed copy. So far I've run into one singular other case of this and have never been able to reproduce the issue myself. I've reprocessed the mentioned avatar so it should be working again however if you run into any other cases like this please do send me the avatar id(s) as I'd really like to get to the bottom of this.",
